:Class Square : ,Shape
⍝ .aplc: a class. Create objects with ⎕NEW:
⍝   s←⎕NEW Square 3 ⋄ s.Area   →   9
    :Field Public Side←1

    ∇ make s
      :Access Public
      :Implements Constructor
      Side←s
    ∇

    ∇ r←Area
      :Implements Method Shape.Area
      r←Side*2
    ∇

    ∇ r←Name
      :Implements Method Shape.Name
      r←'square'
    ∇
:EndClass
